    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monstrata is a fast turn-based tactics game that takes inspiration from competitive Pok\u00e9mon and Into the Breach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836190/extras/53dbb72ab4c71f68de675860d001e1e7.poster.avif?t=1751034919\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836190/extras/53dbb72ab4c71f68de675860d001e1e7.webm?t=1751034919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836190/extras/53dbb72ab4c71f68de675860d001e1e7.mp4?t=1751034919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both players choose their commands\u00a0<strong>at the same time</strong>, so anticipating attacks is very important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commands play out by alternating: <strong>RED -&gt; BLUE -&gt; RED -&gt; BLUE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(And team priority swaps each turn.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836190/extras/8ef8c8324704fa4ee1de2f3362c53581.poster.avif?t=1751034919\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836190/extras/8ef8c8324704fa4ee1de2f3362c53581.webm?t=1751034919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836190/extras/8ef8c8324704fa4ee1de2f3362c53581.mp4?t=1751034919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The attacks in Monstrata focus on positioning, with abilities that push, reflect, launch and chain. Invent new combinations of monsters to take your opponents by surprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836190/extras/1b01f175a923c14ad4ee679347b0757b.poster.avif?t=1751034919\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836190/extras/1b01f175a923c14ad4ee679347b0757b.webm?t=1751034919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836190/extras/1b01f175a923c14ad4ee679347b0757b.mp4?t=1751034919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monstrata is in early development and I'd love to hear from monster taming and tactics fans. Wishlist on Steam and join the Discord to get involved!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monstrata is a fast turn-based tactics game that takes inspiration from competitive Pok\u00e9mon and Into the Breach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836190/extras/53dbb72ab4c71f68de675860d001e1e7.poster.avif?t=1751034919\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836190/extras/53dbb72ab4c71f68de675860d001e1e7.webm?t=1751034919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836190/extras/53dbb72ab4c71f68de675860d001e1e7.mp4?t=1751034919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both players choose their commands\u00a0<strong>at the same time</strong>, so anticipating attacks is very important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commands play out by alternating: <strong>RED -&gt; BLUE -&gt; RED -&gt; BLUE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(And team priority swaps each turn.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836190/extras/8ef8c8324704fa4ee1de2f3362c53581.poster.avif?t=1751034919\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836190/extras/8ef8c8324704fa4ee1de2f3362c53581.webm?t=1751034919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836190/extras/8ef8c8324704fa4ee1de2f3362c53581.mp4?t=1751034919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The attacks in Monstrata focus on positioning, with abilities that push, reflect, launch and chain. Invent new combinations of monsters to take your opponents by surprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836190/extras/1b01f175a923c14ad4ee679347b0757b.poster.avif?t=1751034919\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836190/extras/1b01f175a923c14ad4ee679347b0757b.webm?t=1751034919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836190/extras/1b01f175a923c14ad4ee679347b0757b.mp4?t=1751034919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monstrata is in early development and I'd love to hear from monster taming and tactics fans. Wishlist on Steam and join the Discord to get involved!</p>",
    "short_description": "Master your monsters' attack patterns in a fast turn-based tactics game. Push, reflect, predict and chain your attacks, solo or online.",
